                "description": "Undeniably alluring in design, the Mach 5 Solid Brass Lever with Square Rose will add a modern accent to any door. The shape of the lever is not only stylish, it is also comfortable to your hand--making it one of the best choices if you are looking to add modern style that is both beautiful and functional to your home. The Mach 5 Lever with Square Rose is available in passage, privacy and dummy functions.\r\n",
